# University of Toronto

> Official information about the University of Toronto’s academics, research, campuses, community, governance, news, and public services.

The University of Toronto is a public research university with three campuses in the Greater Toronto Area: St. George, Mississauga, and Scarborough.

This file highlights stable, authoritative pages on the University’s central website and selected official University services. It is intended as a concise guide to the most important public information and is not a complete sitemap.

